<title>SOUTH AFRICA: WINBEL, WINHOLD IN TALKS ON PLASTALL UNIT.</title>
<headline>WINBEL, WINHOLD IN TALKS ON PLASTALL UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firms Winbel and Winhold said on Monday that talks are still in progress on their listed Plastall unit which could have an impact on their share prices.</p>
<p>The firms urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in their shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
